    {
      "id": "claim_927ba847318c42209b0fc2672be03111",
      "statement": "`PortfolioRepository` is an abstract interface in `src/account/repository.py` (`get`, `get_by_user`, `create`, `sync_accounts`, `update`, `delete`, all schema-typed) implemented by `SqlAlchemyPortfolioRepository`, whose `get`/`get_by_user` selectinload the `portfolio_accounts → account` chain and project each membership into a full `AccountSchema`, and whose `sync_accounts` is a full replacement (delete all membership rows then insert the new set, deduplicated via `set(...)`) rather than a diff. The interface/implementation pair is registered in `src/account/registry.py` via `sqlalchemy_portfolio_repository_factory`, next to `PortfolioService`.",
      "evidence": [
