      "id": "claim_349a677fc090410fa3281c86f5d5dadf",
      "statement": "`PortfolioService` validates before every write but does not itself compare `user_id`: `create_portfolio` and `sync_portfolio_accounts` call `AccountService.check_accounts_belong_to_user` first, `update_portfolio`/`delete_portfolio`/`sync_portfolio_accounts` call `get_portfolio` first (raising `PortfolioNotFoundError` on an unknown id instead of silently no-oping), and `check_accounts_belong_to_user` is a set-superset test over the caller's own accounts that rejects both foreign and nonexistent account ids with `AccountsDoNotBelongToUserError`.",
