    {
      "id": "claim_e374c9b3b5fd4de8aede19094e575490",
      "statement": "`portfolio_router` (prefix `/portfolios`, mounted under `/api/v1`) exposes exactly five handlers — `GET /` (list for the current user), `POST /` (`{ name, accounts }` create), `PUT /{portfolio_id}/accounts` (full membership replacement), `PATCH /{portfolio_id}` (rename), `DELETE /{portfolio_id}` (hard delete returning a bare 204) — with no single-portfolio GET and no endpoint that changes name and membership together.",
