    {
      "id": "claim_92d7364f09f4494b9920c6d0e7fb832e",
      "statement": "The `/holdings` filter seam resolves a portfolio client-side into account ids: `+page.server.ts` returns `portfolio_id` / `account_id` from `url.searchParams` verbatim alongside the `portfolios` and `accounts` lists fetched in the same `Promise.allSettled` pass without filtering holdings, and the page's first `$effect` looks the portfolio up in `data.portfolios`, maps `portfolio.accounts.map(a => a.id)` and calls `service.filterByPortfolio(data.portfolio_id, accountIds)`, with an unknown id degrading to an empty account list rather than an error. A dropdown selection repeats the resolution and `goto`s `/holdings?portfolio_id={id}` with `replaceState: true, noScroll: true, keepFocus: true`.",
      "evidence": [
